<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V NEW ZEALAND SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the third</p>
<p>and final one-day international between Pakistan and New Zealand</p>
<p>on Sunday:</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p> Saeed Anwar c Young b Vaughan	    16</p>
<p> Zahoor Elahi b Hart			  51</p>
<p> Inzamamul Haq st Germon b Hart	    7</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmad not out			   73</p>
<p> Mohammad Wasim c and b Harris	     8</p>
<p> Wasim Akram not out			  66</p>
<p> Extras (lb-5 w-5 nb-3)		     13</p>
<p>Total (for four wickets in 50 overs)  234</p>
<p>Did not bat: Shahid Afridi, Moin Khan, Mushtaq Ahmad, Saqlain</p>
<p>Mushtaq, Mohammad Zahid.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-38 2-62 3-103 4-126</p>
<p>Bowling: Simon Doull 4-0-23-0 (w1), Justin Vaughan 10-3-59-1</p>
<p>(w3), Chris Cairns 9-0-45-0 (nb2), Nathan Astle 8-2-27-0 (w1),</p>
<p>Matthew Hart 10-1-33-2 (nb1), Chris Harris 9-0-42-1</p>
<p>New Zealand</p>
<p> B.Young c Wasim Akram b Shahid Afridi  32</p>
<p> N.Astle run out				60</p>
<p> A.Parore c Moin Khan b Wasim Akram     47</p>
<p> S.Fleming not out			    48</p>
<p> C.Cairns not out			     25</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-10 nb-6 w-6)		23</p>
<p> Total (for 3 wickets, 45.1 overs)     235</p>
<p>Did not bat: C.Harris, M.Greatbatch, L.Germon, M.Hart, J.Vaughan, S.Doull.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-96 2-99 3-183.</p>
<p>Bowling: Wasim Akram 8-0-36-1 (nb4 w2), Mohammad Zahid 6-0-41-0 (1w), Mushtaq Ahmad 10-0-49-0 (1w), Saqlain Mushtaq 10-0-43-0 (1nb, 1w) Shahid Afridi 8.1-1-39-1, Ijaz Ahmad 1-0-6-0 (1nb), Saeed Anwar 2-0-10-0 (1w).</p>
<p>Result: New Zealand won by 7 wickets.</p>
